            </a>
          </aside>
        </article>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="habilidades" class="habilidades" hidden aria-hidden="true">
    <h2>Habilidades</h2>
    <div class="habilidades-container">
      <article class="habilidad-item">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z"/></svg>
        <p>Inglés y español, tanto oral como escrito, nivel B2+ o superior.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="habilidad-item">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96z"/></svg>
        <p>Sólido conocimiento de la arquitectura y los componentes de UiPath.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="habilidad-item">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 13H4c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1v6c0 .55.45 1 1 1h16c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-6c0-.55-.45-1-1-1zM7 19c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2s.9-2 2-2 2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2zM20 3H4c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1v6c0 .55.45 1 1 1h16c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V4c0-.55-.45-1-1-1zM7 9c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2s.9-2 2-2 2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2z"/></svg>
        <p>Experiencia en administración de servidores Windows y Linux.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="habilidad-item">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM19 18H6c-2.21 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.05 1.53-3.76 3.56-3.97l1.07-.11.5-.95C8.08 7.14 9.94 6 12 6c3.04 0 5.5 2.46 5.5 5.5v.5H19c1.66 0 3 1.34 3 3s-1.34 3-3 3z"/></svg>
        <p>Experiencia trabajando con entornos Cloud como Azure y AWS.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="habilidad-item">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96z"/></svg>
        <p>Experiencia con plataformas Cloud como AWS, Azure o GCP.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="habilidad-item">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 13H4c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1v6c0 .55.45 1 1 1h16c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-6c0-.55-.45-1-1-1zM7 19c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2s.9-2 2-2 2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2zM20 3H4c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1v6c0 .55.45 1 1 1h16c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V4c0-.55-.45-1-1-1zM7 9c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2s.9-2 2-2 2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2z"/></svg>
